[00:07.086]The time has come to pack away
{"是时候将一切收拾封存"}
[00:14.544]all the joys
{"所有欢乐时光"}
[00:18.654]You don't wanna hear my apology
{"你不想听我的道歉"}
[00:21.704]Get it off my chest
{"一吐为快"}
[00:23.106]I would do my best
{"我会竭尽全力"}
[00:24.684]I know what you fear
{"我知你恐惧为何"}
[00:26.189]Similarities we possess
{"我们共有的相似之处"}
[00:30.369]Never will I pass the test
{"我永远无法通过考验"}
[00:34.440]The scene is fading
{"场景逐渐褪色"}
[00:36.250]Can my soul be put to rest?
{"我的灵魂能否安息？"}
[00:41.534]Death is gonna come for me
{"死亡终将降临于我"}
[00:44.520]Be the change I couldn't be
{"成为我未能做到的改变"}
[00:47.592]Can you find a life
{"能否寻得童话般"}
[00:48.893]that's like fairytales?
{"的人生？"}
[00:51.335]Far from this tragedy
{"远离这场悲剧"}
[00:53.564]Sad you had to wait for me
{"抱歉让你苦等我"}
[00:56.495]Feels like an eternity
{"恍若永恒般漫长"}
[00:59.572]Please forgive me for my sins
{"请宽恕我的罪孽"}
[01:01.894]Angels wings lifting
{"天使之翼轻托"}
[01:03.969]and setting me free
{"予我自由"}
